 se!\n\nThese extra transfers are available to help you reshape your squad a
 head of the Africa Cup of Nations (AFCON)\, which begins on 21 December.\n\
 nRemember your chips\, too. For the first time in Fantasy\, you have two Be
 nch Boost\, Triple Captain and Free Hit chips\, with one set for each half 
 of the season.\n\nAll first-half chips must be used before the Gameweek 19 
 deadline\, 18:00 GMT on Tuesday 30 December. Any unused chips will expire. 
 Don’t forget\, only one chip can be played per Gameweek.\n\nNow\, get you
 rself ready for Gameweek 16 - and remember\, deadlines are 90 minutes befor
